@working_hours
view-if: working_hours < 2
on-arrival: working_hours += 1; socialist_dissent -= 8; humanist_dissent -= 5; socialist_strength += 5; workers_kcp += 7*(1-dissent);

Now, with the force of the Labor Ministry, we are finally enforcing the rights of workers to their own time.

@safety
on-arrival: workers_safety += 1; socialist_dissent -= 5; humanist_strength += 2; workers_kcp += 5*(1-dissent); 

The Labor Ministry works on developing and enforcing safety regulations, in order to ensure healty working conditions for the proletariat.
